## Slide 16

Task Form Item Properties 

Conditionals
Task Form Items can also be assigned Conditional Logic. When marked “Is Conditional”, new Tasks will hide the Task Item until the Condition is met.

Conditional Logic
Conditional Logic can reference other Task Items within the same Task. The logic is evaluated each time the Task is saved.

