## Slide 18

Task Entities 

Controls the creation and processing of  task records
Tasks hold the required inputs from users and required timestamps.
Examples
Line 1 HACCP
Line 2 HACCP
Line 3 HACCP
Task Definition
A grouping mechanism that is referenced by Task Forms.
When the task is shown, the Task Form Item Groups represent headers.
Examples
Common signatures
Cleaning checks
Task Form Item
Group
Individual inputs housed in Task Form Item Groups
When the task is shown, the Task Form Items represent individual inputs.
Examples
Name
Number of tablets
Task Form Item
A grouping mechanism that gets assigned to Task Definitions.
It includes versioning and shared content.
Examples
HACCP
Quality Check
Changeover Checklist
